# Let's redefine faces for dome for cleaner structure
# Faces for dome using triangulation from segments for smoother appearance

# First ring of triangles (from center top v1)
f 1/5/1 2/1/2 10/2/2
f 1/5/1 10/1/3 3/2/3
f 1/5/1 3/1/3 11/2/4
f 1/5/1 11/1/4 4/2/5
