# Faces for dome segments (quads between rings)
# Ring 1 to Ring 2
f 2/1/2 3/2/3 11/3/4 10/4/3
f 3/1/3 4/2/4 12/3/5 11/4/4
f 4/1/4 5/2/5 13/3/6 12/4/5
