f 9/1/10 17/2/11 18/3/12 10/4/10

# Let's simplify the dome faces to make it easier to follow, using 3 rings (top point, mid ring, bottom ring)
# Top point: v1
# Mid ring: v2-v9
# Bottom ring: v17-v24

# Faces from center (v1) to mid ring (v2-v9)
f 1/5/1 2/1/2 3/2/3
f 1/5/1 3/1/3 4/2/4
f 1/5/1 4/1/4 5/2/5
f 1/5/1 5/1/5 6/2/6
