# Faces between mid ring (v2-v9) and bottom ring (v17-v24)
f 2/1/2 17/2/6 18/3/7 3/4/3
f 3/1/3 18/2/7 19/3/8 4/4/4
f 4/1/4 19/2/8 20/3/9 5/4/5
f 5/1/5 20/2/9 21/3/10 6/4/6
