# Let's simplify the bottom of the base.
# It will be a flat circle connecting the bottom ring of the base (v41-v48) to the center (v49).
# Bottom face of base
f 49/5/21 41/1/21 48/2/21
f 49/5/21 48/1/21 47/2/21
f 49/5/21 47/1/21 46/2/21
f 49/5/21 46/1/21 45/2/21
